sequenceDiagram
  participant Detector as OP detector / EP watchdog
  participant Stop as Emergency Stop
  participant FW as Egress firewall
  participant Broker as Credential Broker
  participant Runner as Runner lifecycle
  participant Evidence as OP evidence
  Detector->>Stop: signed stop reason
  par block execution
    Stop->>FW: revoke leases and drop traffic
  and revoke identity
    Stop->>Broker: revoke handles/sessions/tokens
  and quarantine
    Stop->>Runner: freeze and quarantine
  end
  Runner->>Evidence: bounded final telemetry
  Evidence-->>Runner: seal acknowledgement or timeout
  Runner->>Runner: destroy and erase key
  Evidence-->>Stop: immutable incident/destruction status
